  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "保險法",
    "sub_ename": "INSURANCE LAW",
    "describe_ch": "為滿足學生廣泛性需要，本課程將彈性的達成下列目標：\r\n1.\t將在前九週與予介紹保險契約基本原理，並說明保險法的強制規定。 \r\n2.後九週，將討論有關保險企業之監督與管理。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "\r\nTo satisfy the diverse needs of students, the course achieves flexibility as follows:\r\n1.\tInterpreting basic theory of Insurance contract and enforces Rules of the Insurance law at the first 9 weeks.\r\n2.\tGoverning the Administration of Insurance Enterprises is also introduced for the following 9 weeks. \r\n",
    "pre_subname": "INSU1001保險學",
    "pre_sub_id3": "INSU1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "INSU1001 INSURANCE",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能獲悉保險契約、保險監理與法律的專業知識。",
      "describe_en": "To know insurance contract and regulations and law."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能理解企業與家庭有關保險契約交易的問題。",
      "describe_en": "Comprehension for solving problems of insurance trade for their families or firms."
    }
  ],
